GE-Hilt-Library
Provenance statement

Every capture and every measurement in this repository is firsthand: recorded
directly from a physical Galaxy's Edge lightsaber hilt on the maintainer's own
bench, or contributed by a named community member from their own hilt (see
CONTRIBUTORS.md). Nothing here is copied from, transcribed from, or numerically
compared against any third party's dataset.

Where the catalog states a fact about a hilt's behavior, that fact is backed by
a capture file included in this repository. The evidence travels with the claim.

Galaxy's Edge, Savi's Workshop, and the lightsaber hilts referenced by name are
products of The Walt Disney Company / Lucasfilm. This project is an independent,
non-commercial fan research effort. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
connected to Disney or Lucasfilm. Hilt and character names are used only to
identify which physical product a capture came from.
